## Leads
| Role | Responsibility |
|---|---|
<!-- if roles.techLead -->
| tech-lead | Takes each task in, decides size and owning squad, splits big work into sequential slices, runs reviewers, reports back. Writes no feature code. |
<!-- if roles.ba -->
| ba | Turns a request into a short brief: user story, scope, acceptance criteria, open questions. |
<!-- if roles.qaLead -->
| qa-lead | Turns acceptance criteria into the test plan per the test policy and signs off required e2e. |

